              "type": "text",
              "text": "In a sport store golf balls are sold either boxed in threes or fours.",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "If there are five times as many boxes of threes as there are boxes of fours, and there are 361 golf balls altogether, find how many boxes have four golf balls in them.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "19 boxes of four golf balls. $19n=361$ gives $n=19$.",
      "worked": "Let $n$ be the number of boxes of four golf balls. Then $5n$ is the number of boxes of three golf balls.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}4n+3(5n)&=361\\\\19n&=361\\\\n&=19\\end{align*}$$\n\nThere are 19 boxes of four golf balls.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 35
